en Statthalters Varus (Schlacht im Teutoburger Wald 9 n. Chr.) und der Verlust fast aller römischen Positionen rechts des Rheins. Wesentliche Kriegsziele waren deshalb die Wiederherstellung der römischen Oberhoheit in Germanien und die Bestrafung der Aufständischen."}},{"id":"Q16629698","l":"Domerian","ll":null,"d":"","dl":null,"t":"event","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16629698","m":{"start_time":"-186000000-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_time":"-182700000-01-01T00:00:00Z"}},{"id":"Q11797081","l":"Latènezeit","ll":null,"d":"Periode der Frühgeschichte in Mitteleuropa","dl":null,"t":"event","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11797081","m":{"start_time":"-0449-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_time":"-0100-01-01T00:00:00Z"}},{"id":"Q1664","l":"Ruhr","ll":null,"d":"rechter Nebenfluss des Niederrheins in Nordrhein-Westfalen","dl":null,"t":"place","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1664","m":{"coordinates":"Point(6.723055555 51.450833333)"}},{"id":"Q246","l":"Volkswagen","ll":null,"d":"Stammmarke der Volkswagen AG","dl":null,"t":"place","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q246","m":{}},{"id":"Q60982430","l":"Schiepziger Gruppe","ll":null,"d":"archäologische Kultur der Jungsteinzeit","dl":null,"t":"event","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q60982430","m":{"end_time":"-3799-01-01T00:00:00Z","start_time":"-4200-01-01T00:00:00Z"}},{"id":"Q149883","l":"Malxe","ll":null,"d":"Fluss in der Niederlausitz","dl":null,"t":"place","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q149883","m":{"coordinates":"Point(14.1866 51.8532)"}},{"id":"Q18994","l":"Luise Rainer","ll":null,"d":"deutsche Schauspielerin (1910-2014)","dl":null,"t":"person","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18994","m":{"birth_date":"1910-01-12T00:00:00Z","occupation":"Schauspieler","death_date":"2014-12-30T00:00:00Z"}},{"id":"Q15140974","l":"Barbarian invasions of the 4rd century","ll":null,"d":"period of invasions of the Roman Empire","dl":null,"t":"event","u":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q15140974","m":{"point_in_time":"0400-01-01T00:00:00Z